
"smart_sources:docs/60_Registro_de_Execucao/CRITICAL_STEPS_IMPLEMENTATION.md": {"path":"docs/60_Registro_de_Execucao/CRITICAL_STEPS_IMPLEMENTATION.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"5kafo3","at":1774581716840},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1773447493304,"size":18508,"at":1774581716842,"hash":"5kafo3"},"blocks":{"#🔴 Implementação dos 4 Passos Críticos - Áquila Pro\\n\\n## 📋 Visão Geral\\n\\nEste documento descreve a implementação completa dos 4 passos críticos que desbloqueiam o MVP funcional do Áquila Pro:\\n\\n1. ✅ **Integração de Reconhecimento Facial com Banco de Dados**\\n2. ✅ **WebSocket para Notificações em Tempo Real**\\n3. ✅ **IPC Handlers para Comunicação Electron-React**\\n4. ✅ **Testes End-to-End do Pipeline Completo**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1️⃣ Integração de Reconhecimento Facial com Banco de Dados\\n\\n### Arquivo: `FaceRecognitionIntegration.ts`\\n\\n**Responsabilidades:**\\n- Processar detecções de face e identificar alunos\\n- Buscar alunos com embeddings similares\\n- Calcular similaridade cosseno entre embeddings\\n- Registrar presença automaticamente\\n- Treinar novos alunos com fotos\\n- Gerar relatórios de presença\\n\\n**Fluxo Principal:**\\n\\n```\\nDetecção de Face\\n      ↓\\nExtrair Embedding\\n      ↓\\nBuscar Alunos Similares\\n      ↓\\nCalcular Similaridade (Cosseno)\\n      ↓\\nRetornar Melhor Correspondência\\n      ↓\\nRegistrar Presença no BD\\n      ↓\\nAtualizar Cache\\n```\\n\\n**Métodos Principais:**\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Processar detecção e identificar aluno\\nasync processDetection(detection: FaceDetection): Promise<StudentMatch | null>\\n\\n// Buscar alunos similares\\nprivate async findSimilarStudents(\\n  embedding: number[],\\n  cameraId: string,\\n  topK: number = 5\\n): Promise<StudentMatch[]>\\n\\n// Calcular similaridade cosseno\\nprivate calculateSimilarity(embedding1: number[], embedding2: number[]): number\\n\\n// Registrar presença\\nprivate async recordAttendance(\\n  studentId: string,\\n  detection: FaceDetection\\n): Promise<void>\\n\\n// Treinar novo aluno\\nasync trainStudent(studentId: string, photoUrls: string[]): Promise<boolean>\\n\\n// Obter relatório de presença\\nasync getStudentAttendanceReport(\\n  studentId: string,\\n  startDate: string,\\n  endDate: string\\n): Promise<AttendanceRecord[]>\\n\\n// Obter estatísticas\\nasync getAttendanceStats(startDate: string, endDate: string): Promise<any>\\n```\\n\\n**Interfaces:**\\n\\n```typescript\\ninterface FaceDetection {\\n  id: string;\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n  width: number;\\n  height: number;\\n  confidence: number;\\n  embedding?: number[];\\n  timestamp: number;\\n  cameraId: string;\\n  frameId: string;\\n}\\n\\ninterface StudentMatch {\\n  studentId: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  confidence: number;\\n  matchedAt: number;\\n  photoId?: string;\\n}\\n\\ninterface AttendanceRecord {\\n  studentId: string;\\n  cameraId: string;\\n  entryTime: number;\\n  exitTime?: number;\\n  confidence: number;\\n  status: 'present' | 'late' | 'absent';\\n  date: string;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n**Exemplo de Uso:**\\n\\n```typescript\\nconst integration = new FaceRecognitionIntegration();\\n\\n// Processar detecção\\nconst match = await integration.processDetection({\\n  id: 'det-123',\\n  x: 100,\\n  y: 100,\\n  width: 150,\\n  height: 200,\\n  confidence: 0.95,\\n  timestamp: Date.now(),\\n  cameraId: 'camera-1',\\n  frameId: 'frame-456',\\n});\\n\\nif (match) {\\n  console.log(`Aluno identificado: ${match.name}`);\\n}\\n\\n// Treinar novo aluno\\nawait integration.trainStudent('student-123', [\\n  'photo1.jpg',\\n  'photo2.jpg',\\n  'photo3.jpg',\\n]);\\n\\n// Obter relatório de presença\\nconst report = await integration.getStudentAttendanceReport(\\n  'student-123',\\n  '2026-03-01',\\n  '2026-03-31'\\n);\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2️⃣ WebSocket para Notificações em Tempo Real\\n\\n### Arquivo: `WebSocketServerComplete.ts`\\n\\n**Responsabilidades:**\\n- Gerenciar conexões WebSocket\\n- Enviar eventos em tempo real\\n- Gerenciar subscriptions de clientes\\n- Manter histórico de mensagens\\n- Suportar múltiplos tipos de eventos\\n\\n**Tipos de Eventos:**\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Evento de Presença\\ninterface AttendanceEvent {\\n  type: 'attendance';\\n  studentId: string;\\n  studentName: string;\\n  cameraId: string;\\n  cameraName: string;\\n  status: 'present' | 'late' | 'absent';\\n  confidence: number;\\n  timestamp: number;\\n}\\n\\n// Evento de Alerta\\ninterface AlertEvent {\\n  type: 'alert';\\n  severity: 'info' | 'warning' | 'critical';\\n  title: string;\\n  message: string;\\n  data?: any;\\n  timestamp: number;\\n}\\n\\n// Evento de Status de Câmera\\ninterface CameraStatusEvent {\\n  type: 'camera_status';\\n  cameraId: string;\\n  cameraName: string;\\n  status: 'online' | 'offline' | 'error';\\n  lastSeen: number;\\n  fps?: number;\\n  latency?: number;\\n}\\n\\n// Evento de Métricas do Sistema\\ninterface SystemMetricsEvent {\\n  type: 'system_metrics';\\n  cpu: number;\\n  ram: number;\\n  disk: number;\\n  fps: number;\\n  latency: number;\\n  activeDetections: number;\\n  timestamp: number;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n**Métodos Principais:**\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Broadcast de evento de presença\\nbroadcastAttendanceEvent(event: AttendanceEvent): void\\n\\n// Broadcast de alerta\\nbroadcastAlertEvent(event: AlertEvent): void\\n\\n// Broadcast de status de câmera\\nbroadcastCameraStatusEvent(event: CameraStatusEvent): void\\n\\n// Broadcast de métricas\\nbroadcastSystemMetricsEvent(event: SystemMetricsEvent): void\\n\\n// Obter número de clientes conectados\\ngetConnectedClientsCount(): number\\n\\n// Obter informações de clientes\\ngetClientsInfo(): any[]\\n\\n// Obter histórico de mensagens\\ngetMessageHistory(limit: number = 100): WebSocketMessage[]\\n```\\n\\n**Exemplo de Uso (Backend):**\\n\\n```typescript\\nconst wss = new WebSocketServerComplete(httpServer, 8080);\\n\\n// Enviar evento de presença\\nwss.broadcastAttendanceEvent({\\n  type: 'attendance',\\n  studentId: 'student-123',\\n  studentName: 'João Silva',\\n  cameraId: 'camera-1',\\n  cameraName: 'Entrada Principal',\\n  status: 'present',\\n  confidence: 0.95,\\n  timestamp: Date.now(),\\n});\\n\\n// Enviar alerta\\nwss.broadcastAlertEvent({\\n  type: 'alert',\\n  severity: 'warning',\\n  title: 'Câmera Offline',\\n  message: 'Câmera da entrada principal está offline',\\n  timestamp: Date.now(),\\n});\\n```\\n\\n**Exemplo de Uso (Frontend React):**\\n\\n```typescript\\nimport { useWebSocket } from '../hooks/useWebSocket';\\n\\nfunction Dashboard() {\\n  const { isConnected, lastMessage } = useWebSocket();\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (lastMessage?.type === 'attendance') {\\n      console.log(`Aluno ${lastMessage.data.studentName} presente`);\\n    }\\n  }, [lastMessage]);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div>\\n      <p>Status: {isConnected ? '🟢 Conectado' : '🔴 Desconectado'}</p>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3️⃣ IPC Handlers para Comunicação Electron-React\\n\\n### Arquivo: `handlers-complete.ts`\\n\\n**Responsabilidades:**\\n- Criar handlers IPC para comunicação Electron-React\\n- Expor funcionalidades do backend para a UI\\n- Validar e tratar erros\\n- Retornar respostas estruturadas\\n\\n**Categorias de Handlers:**\\n\\n### Câmeras\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Iniciar captura\\nipcMain.handle('camera:start', async (event, cameraId: string) => {...})\\n\\n// Parar captura\\nipcMain.handle('camera:stop', async (event, cameraId: string) => {...})\\n\\n// Obter status\\nipcMain.handle('camera:status', async (event, cameraId: string) => {...})\\n\\n// Listar câmeras\\nipcMain.handle('camera:list', async (event) => {...})\\n\\n// Adicionar câmera\\nipcMain.handle('camera:add', async (event, cameraData: any) => {...})\\n```\\n\\n### Presença\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Obter presença do aluno\\nipcMain.handle('attendance:get', async (event, studentId: string, date: string) => {...})\\n\\n// Obter estatísticas\\nipcMain.handle('attendance:stats', async (event, startDate: string, endDate: string) => {...})\\n```\\n\\n### Alunos\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Listar alunos\\nipcMain.handle('students:list', async (event) => {...})\\n\\n// Adicionar aluno\\nipcMain.handle('students:add', async (event, studentData: any) => {...})\\n\\n// Treinar aluno\\nipcMain.handle('students:train', async (event, studentId: string, photoUrls: string[]) => {...})\\n```\\n\\n### Relatórios\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Gerar relatório\\nipcMain.handle('reports:attendance', async (event, filters: any) => {...})\\n\\n// Exportar PDF\\nipcMain.handle('reports:export-pdf', async (event, reportData: any) => {...})\\n\\n// Exportar Excel\\nipcMain.handle('reports:export-excel', async (event, reportData: any) => {...})\\n```\\n\\n### Alertas\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Listar alertas\\nipcMain.handle('alerts:list', async (event, filters?: any) => {...})\\n\\n// Marcar como lido\\nipcMain.handle('alerts:mark-read', async (event, alertId: string) => {...})\\n```\\n\\n### Sistema\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Obter status\\nipcMain.handle('system:status', async (event) => {...})\\n\\n// Fazer backup\\nipcMain.handle('system:backup', async (event) => {...})\\n\\n// Restaurar backup\\nipcMain.handle('system:restore', async (event, backupId: string) => {...})\\n\\n// Obter logs\\nipcMain.handle('system:logs', async (event, limit: number = 100) => {...})\\n```\\n\\n**Exemplo de Uso (Frontend):**\\n\\n```typescript\\nimport { useIPC } from '../hooks/useIPC';\\n\\nfunction CameraManager() {\\n  const { invoke } = useIPC();\\n\\n  const handleStartCamera = async (cameraId: string) => {\\n    const result = await invoke('camera:start', cameraId);\\n    if (result.success) {\\n      console.log('Câmera iniciada');\\n    } else {\\n      console.error(result.error);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <button onClick={() => handleStartCamera('camera-1')}>\\n      Iniciar Câmera\\n    </button>\\n  );\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4️⃣ Testes End-to-End do Pipeline Completo\\n\\n### Arquivo: `EndToEndTesting.ts`\\n\\n**Responsabilidades:**\\n- Executar suite completa de testes\\n- Validar cada etapa do pipeline\\n- Gerar relatórios de teste\\n- Medir performance\\n\\n**Testes Implementados:**\\n\\n1. **Database Connection** - Validar conexão com BD\\n2. **Database Schema** - Verificar tabelas necessárias\\n3. **Data Integrity** - Validar integridade dos dados\\n4. **Face Embedding Extraction** - Testar extração de embeddings\\n5. **Face Similarity Calculation** - Testar cálculo de similaridade\\n6. **Student Training** - Testar treinamento de alunos\\n7. **Camera Connection** - Validar conexão com câmeras\\n8. **Frame Processing** - Testar processamento de frames\\n9. **Detection Accuracy** - Validar precisão de detecção\\n10. **Attendance Recording** - Testar registro de presença\\n11. **End-to-End Flow** - Testar fluxo completo\\n12. **Performance** - Medir performance do sistema\\n\\n**Métodos Principais:**\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Executar suite completa\\nasync runFullTestSuite(): Promise<EndToEndTestReport>\\n\\n// Obter relatório formatado\\nprivate generateReport(totalDuration: number): EndToEndTestReport\\n\\n// Imprimir relatório\\nprivate printReport(report: EndToEndTestReport): void\\n```\\n\\n**Exemplo de Uso:**\\n\\n```typescript\\nconst tester = new EndToEndTesting();\\nconst report = await tester.runFullTestSuite();\\n\\nconsole.log(`Total de Testes: ${report.totalTests}`);\\nconsole.log(`✅ Passaram: ${report.passedTests}`);\\nconsole.log(`❌ Falharam: ${report.failedTests}`);\\nconsole.log(`⏱️  Duração: ${report.totalDuration}ms`);\\n```\\n\\n**Estrutura do Relatório:**\\n\\n```typescript\\ninterface EndToEndTestReport {\\n  timestamp: Date;\\n  totalTests: number;\\n  passedTests: number;\\n  failedTests: number;\\n  skippedTests: number;\\n  totalDuration: number;\\n  results: TestResult[];\\n  systemMetrics: any;\\n}\\n\\ninterface TestResult {\\n  name: string;\\n  status: 'passed' | 'failed' | 'skipped';\\n  duration: number;\\n  error?: string;\\n  details?: any;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔗 Integração dos 4 Passos\\n\\n### Fluxo Completo:\\n\\n```\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                    APLICATIVO ELECTRON                      │\\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n│                                                             │\\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\\n│  │         INTERFACE REACT (Dashboard, etc)             │  │\\n│  │                                                      │  │\\n│  │  ◄─── IPC Handlers (Passo 3) ───►                  │  │\\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\\n│                      ▲                                      │\\n│                      │ IPC                                  │\\n│                      ▼                                      │\\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\\n│  │         BACKEND (Node.js/Electron)                  │  │\\n│  │                                                      │  │\\n│  │  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │  │\\n│  │  │  ProcessingPipeline                            │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ VideoCapture                               │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ FrameProcessor (YOLO)                      │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ FaceRecognitionIntegration (Passo 1) ◄─┐  │ │  │\\n│  │  │  └─ PresenceTracker                          │  │ │  │\\n│  │  └────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │  │\\n│  │                      │                              │  │\\n│  │                      ▼                              │  │\\n│  │  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │  │\\n│  │  │  WebSocketServer (Passo 2)                     │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ Attendance Events                          │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ Alert Events                               │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ Camera Status Events                        │ │  │\\n│  │  │  └─ System Metrics Events                       │ │  │\\n│  │  └────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │  │\\n│  │                      │                              │  │\\n│  │                      ▼                              │  │\\n│  │  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │  │\\n│  │  │  Database (MySQL/SQLite)                       │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ students                                   │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ cameras                                    │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ attendance                                 │ │  │\\n│  │  │  └─ alerts                                     │ │  │\\n│  │  └────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │  │\\n│  │                                                      │  │\\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\\n│                                                             │\\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\\n│  │  EndToEndTesting (Passo 4)                           │  │\\n│  │  ├─ Validar cada componente                          │  │\\n│  │  ├─ Testar fluxo completo                            │  │\\n│  │  └─ Gerar relatório                                  │  │\\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\\n│                                                             │\\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📊 Checklist de Implementação\\n\\n- [x] FaceRecognitionIntegration.ts\\n  - [x] processDetection()\\n  - [x] findSimilarStudents()\\n  - [x] calculateSimilarity()\\n  - [x] recordAttendance()\\n  - [x] trainStudent()\\n  - [x] getStudentAttendanceReport()\\n  - [x] getAttendanceStats()\\n\\n- [x] WebSocketServerComplete.ts\\n  - [x] setupConnectionHandler()\\n  - [x] broadcastAttendanceEvent()\\n  - [x] broadcastAlertEvent()\\n  - [x] broadcastCameraStatusEvent()\\n  - [x] broadcastSystemMetricsEvent()\\n  - [x] getConnectedClientsCount()\\n  - [x] getClientsInfo()\\n  - [x] getMessageHistory()\\n\\n- [x] handlers-complete.ts\\n  - [x] camera:start, camera:stop, camera:status, camera:list, camera:add\\n  - [x] attendance:get, attendance:stats\\n  - [x] students:list, students:add, students:train\\n  - [x] reports:attendance, reports:export-pdf, reports:export-excel\\n  - [x] alerts:list, alerts:mark-read\\n  - [x] system:status, system:backup, system:restore, system:logs\\n\\n- [x] EndToEndTesting.ts\\n  - [x] runFullTestSuite()\\n  - [x] 12 testes implementados\\n  - [x] generateReport()\\n  - [x] printReport()\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🚀 Próximos Passos\\n\\nCom os 4 passos críticos implementados, o sistema está pronto para:\\n\\n1. **Testes em Produção** - Validar com dados reais\\n2. **Otimizações** - Melhorar performance\\n3. **Passos 5-10 (ALTA)** - Implementar MVP completo\\n4. **Passos 11-20** - Qualidade e polimento\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📞 Suporte\\n\\nPara dúvidas sobre implementação, consulte:\\n- `SCALABILITY_ANALYSIS.md` - Requisitos de hardware\\n- `ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md` - Topologias de arquitetura\\n- `MIGRATION_PLAYBOOK.md` - Guia de migração\\n":[1,2]},"outlinks":[],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},
"smart_sources:docs/60_Registro_de_Execucao/CRITICAL_STEPS_IMPLEMENTATION.md": {"path":"docs/60_Registro_de_Execucao/CRITICAL_STEPS_IMPLEMENTATION.md","embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.07499931,0.01619656,0.01191582,-0.00658398,-0.06547037,0.03397417,-0.03402335,-0.01546147,0.01323681,0.01284185,-0.02763505,-0.08935054,0.00300271,0.01064317,0.01213038,0.01646033,0.01341057,0.05623434,-0.00335272,0.00705404,0.08403535,-0.01049298,-0.0150806,-0.04033728,0.00783824,0.05040724,0.02809854,-0.02380519,-0.01552938,-0.23745477,0.0075532,-0.06277636,0.01764365,-0.00421718,-0.02853009,-0.03217567,-0.04292747,-0.00587927,-0.0619094,0.02818282,-0.02963481,0.0472783,-0.05158994,-0.0079581,-0.01508528,-0.0408047,-0.01528493,-0.0033407,-0.04524565,-0.01107507,-0.02814227,0.00271704,0.00343518,0.00394875,-0.04493435,0.05075829,0.08650896,0.03627056,0.06425016,0.08891848,0.05928535,0.0419318,-0.19891566,0.06561534,0.0018395,0.0259218,-0.03891553,0.01059822,-0.02645686,0.06193267,-0.0104081,-0.05055226,0.06468158,0.0267781,0.0089378,0.02375178,0.03102113,-0.04622241,-0.00691631,-0.02422651,0.0000449,0.05134847,-0.02322856,-0.0272541,-0.01907029,-0.02095475,0.0524091,-0.04109455,0.02219894,0.0584495,-0.05892559,0.02548263,0.03684251,0.00726576,0.0048562,-0.03301626,-0.00611127,0.0359369,-0.04594516,0.07818691,-0.0039189,0.01491372,-0.01161856,0.00475963,0.06392217,-0.01501402,0.04892609,-0.04313518,-0.01578687,0.00386118,-0.05674087,-0.06451597,0.03582877,-0.08084089,-0.01543411,0.03154395,0.01925846,0.01531488,0.04292449,-0.02593125,0.05945085,0.01544258,0.07379758,0.00053676,0.06975525,-0.02398637,0.05242313,0.04232134,0.01112617,0.06828937,0.05339777,0.08210333,-0.01149616,0.04148684,-0.06350204,0.03245559,-0.02256869,-0.00662698,-0.02292451,-0.0037809,-0.00300156,0.01498765,-0.00135302,-0.07631588,-0.0499694,0.0842151,-0.00096108,0.05556913,-0.04774956,-0.02360617,0.0028849,0.08025067,-0.06000804,0.01828521,-0.06388668,-0.00733069,-0.0396568,0.0652467,-0.07246958,0.05554515,-0.03287033,-0.0509684,-0.02143745,0.12756664,0.0453167,-0.1013628,0.02826526,0.03498844,0.02879982,-0.0154387,-0.00391668,-0.01689044,-0.00028541,-0.04600939,0.03053684,0.01869373,-0.02579268,-0.01577676,-0.01646334,-0.01384813,0.04918669,-0.06271429,-0.08597615,0.01533549,0.00673047,0.00790513,-0.00071783,-0.04912205,0.05313225,0.02985728,-0.07599393,0.01813867,-0.00571932,0.02988569,0.00791753,0.05316248,0.00222002,-0.07777899,-0.02953583,0.01596593,0.1128667,0.03560295,-0.0283721,-0.01320877,-0.00177519,0.0185181,-0.07763077,0.02493825,0.08389283,0.03397997,-0.05771744,0.03310099,0.05107431,0.01012397,-0.00415986,-0.00456005,0.02687636,0.09451535,-0.00791827,0.02790224,-0.00797605,0.03153691,-0.03602416,-0.23256239,0.02509255,0.01798252,0.03725775,0.03933874,-0.0705363,0.05902256,0.00754677,0.03834479,0.03823467,0.08074386,0.04978324,-0.05665771,0.02703725,-0.05105182,0.01882748,0.03052763,-0.0077159,-0.03420176,-0.00306049,-0.05899192,0.01341292,0.02936331,-0.06153469,0.03506652,0.00063968,0.12985006,0.00885363,0.03739524,-0.02262132,0.04873604,0.02967477,-0.03957228,-0.0992907,0.08208761,0.02561293,0.07057764,-0.01766879,0.03144415,-0.06948093,0.01478484,0.04084663,0.03159528,-0.07967957,-0.06407604,-0.01472139,-0.01029531,0.00312808,-0.06952365,0.00625991,-0.00027591,0.02765404,-0.0040419,0.0184878,0.03850193,-0.05022872,-0.05661782,-0.02556646,-0.05894985,0.0255167,-0.01596263,-0.00128742,-0.04586791,-0.02697967,0.01108632,0.03582052,-0.01269446,-0.01687458,0.06909972,-0.02998281,0.01044443,0.19520801,0.00346811,-0.03542848,0.04511115,0.02821773,0.01431797,-0.07486187,-0.04692709,-0.02423722,0.02105326,-0.00377371,0.03274069,0.02770444,-0.01340811,0.05312405,0.05260105,-0.08515031,-0.0070918,-0.03501385,0.01074115,-0.00112796,-0.07451769,-0.05056396,0.03128811,-0.02157993,-0.293506,-0.05752229,0.01265144,0.01717003,-0.01824589,0.00599697,0.0581092,-0.07548396,-0.02496957,0.00901269,-0.01148261,0.09147611,0.02776229,0.01004613,-0.02317073,0.02033458,0.02352696,-0.06966387,0.11190972,-0.0309782,-0.02083392,-0.02125917,0.20500322,-0.01547657,-0.01351955,0.03530695,-0.03436925,0.05373701,0.09327235,0.0279095,-0.006303,-0.00829829,0.05027014,-0.01531004,0.00753809,0.05166995,-0.04923921,0.00846054,0.02355699,-0.03436624,-0.03470955,-0.0174713,0.05520519,-0.04859847,0.07074027,-0.00288588,-0.06598545,-0.04256669,0.00342545,0.01563961,-0.01848935,-0.04991831,-0.01417521,0.00659101,0.04368044,0.05076228,-0.02316643,-0.03598,-0.09582999,-0.030085,0.02269384,-0.00028284,0.02318798,0.0652341,0.01460563],"last_embed":{"hash":"5kafo3","tokens":471}}},"last_read":{"hash":"5kafo3","at":1774741628200},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1773447493304,"size":18508,"at":1774581716842,"hash":"5kafo3"},"blocks":{"#🔴 Implementação dos 4 Passos Críticos - Áquila Pro\\n\\n## 📋 Visão Geral\\n\\nEste documento descreve a implementação completa dos 4 passos críticos que desbloqueiam o MVP funcional do Áquila Pro:\\n\\n1. ✅ **Integração de Reconhecimento Facial com Banco de Dados**\\n2. ✅ **WebSocket para Notificações em Tempo Real**\\n3. ✅ **IPC Handlers para Comunicação Electron-React**\\n4. ✅ **Testes End-to-End do Pipeline Completo**\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1️⃣ Integração de Reconhecimento Facial com Banco de Dados\\n\\n### Arquivo: `FaceRecognitionIntegration.ts`\\n\\n**Responsabilidades:**\\n- Processar detecções de face e identificar alunos\\n- Buscar alunos com embeddings similares\\n- Calcular similaridade cosseno entre embeddings\\n- Registrar presença automaticamente\\n- Treinar novos alunos com fotos\\n- Gerar relatórios de presença\\n\\n**Fluxo Principal:**\\n\\n```\\nDetecção de Face\\n      ↓\\nExtrair Embedding\\n      ↓\\nBuscar Alunos Similares\\n      ↓\\nCalcular Similaridade (Cosseno)\\n      ↓\\nRetornar Melhor Correspondência\\n      ↓\\nRegistrar Presença no BD\\n      ↓\\nAtualizar Cache\\n```\\n\\n**Métodos Principais:**\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Processar detecção e identificar aluno\\nasync processDetection(detection: FaceDetection): Promise<StudentMatch | null>\\n\\n// Buscar alunos similares\\nprivate async findSimilarStudents(\\n  embedding: number[],\\n  cameraId: string,\\n  topK: number = 5\\n): Promise<StudentMatch[]>\\n\\n// Calcular similaridade cosseno\\nprivate calculateSimilarity(embedding1: number[], embedding2: number[]): number\\n\\n// Registrar presença\\nprivate async recordAttendance(\\n  studentId: string,\\n  detection: FaceDetection\\n): Promise<void>\\n\\n// Treinar novo aluno\\nasync trainStudent(studentId: string, photoUrls: string[]): Promise<boolean>\\n\\n// Obter relatório de presença\\nasync getStudentAttendanceReport(\\n  studentId: string,\\n  startDate: string,\\n  endDate: string\\n): Promise<AttendanceRecord[]>\\n\\n// Obter estatísticas\\nasync getAttendanceStats(startDate: string, endDate: string): Promise<any>\\n```\\n\\n**Interfaces:**\\n\\n```typescript\\ninterface FaceDetection {\\n  id: string;\\n  x: number;\\n  y: number;\\n  width: number;\\n  height: number;\\n  confidence: number;\\n  embedding?: number[];\\n  timestamp: number;\\n  cameraId: string;\\n  frameId: string;\\n}\\n\\ninterface StudentMatch {\\n  studentId: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  confidence: number;\\n  matchedAt: number;\\n  photoId?: string;\\n}\\n\\ninterface AttendanceRecord {\\n  studentId: string;\\n  cameraId: string;\\n  entryTime: number;\\n  exitTime?: number;\\n  confidence: number;\\n  status: 'present' | 'late' | 'absent';\\n  date: string;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n**Exemplo de Uso:**\\n\\n```typescript\\nconst integration = new FaceRecognitionIntegration();\\n\\n// Processar detecção\\nconst match = await integration.processDetection({\\n  id: 'det-123',\\n  x: 100,\\n  y: 100,\\n  width: 150,\\n  height: 200,\\n  confidence: 0.95,\\n  timestamp: Date.now(),\\n  cameraId: 'camera-1',\\n  frameId: 'frame-456',\\n});\\n\\nif (match) {\\n  console.log(`Aluno identificado: ${match.name}`);\\n}\\n\\n// Treinar novo aluno\\nawait integration.trainStudent('student-123', [\\n  'photo1.jpg',\\n  'photo2.jpg',\\n  'photo3.jpg',\\n]);\\n\\n// Obter relatório de presença\\nconst report = await integration.getStudentAttendanceReport(\\n  'student-123',\\n  '2026-03-01',\\n  '2026-03-31'\\n);\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2️⃣ WebSocket para Notificações em Tempo Real\\n\\n### Arquivo: `WebSocketServerComplete.ts`\\n\\n**Responsabilidades:**\\n- Gerenciar conexões WebSocket\\n- Enviar eventos em tempo real\\n- Gerenciar subscriptions de clientes\\n- Manter histórico de mensagens\\n- Suportar múltiplos tipos de eventos\\n\\n**Tipos de Eventos:**\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Evento de Presença\\ninterface AttendanceEvent {\\n  type: 'attendance';\\n  studentId: string;\\n  studentName: string;\\n  cameraId: string;\\n  cameraName: string;\\n  status: 'present' | 'late' | 'absent';\\n  confidence: number;\\n  timestamp: number;\\n}\\n\\n// Evento de Alerta\\ninterface AlertEvent {\\n  type: 'alert';\\n  severity: 'info' | 'warning' | 'critical';\\n  title: string;\\n  message: string;\\n  data?: any;\\n  timestamp: number;\\n}\\n\\n// Evento de Status de Câmera\\ninterface CameraStatusEvent {\\n  type: 'camera_status';\\n  cameraId: string;\\n  cameraName: string;\\n  status: 'online' | 'offline' | 'error';\\n  lastSeen: number;\\n  fps?: number;\\n  latency?: number;\\n}\\n\\n// Evento de Métricas do Sistema\\ninterface SystemMetricsEvent {\\n  type: 'system_metrics';\\n  cpu: number;\\n  ram: number;\\n  disk: number;\\n  fps: number;\\n  latency: number;\\n  activeDetections: number;\\n  timestamp: number;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n**Métodos Principais:**\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Broadcast de evento de presença\\nbroadcastAttendanceEvent(event: AttendanceEvent): void\\n\\n// Broadcast de alerta\\nbroadcastAlertEvent(event: AlertEvent): void\\n\\n// Broadcast de status de câmera\\nbroadcastCameraStatusEvent(event: CameraStatusEvent): void\\n\\n// Broadcast de métricas\\nbroadcastSystemMetricsEvent(event: SystemMetricsEvent): void\\n\\n// Obter número de clientes conectados\\ngetConnectedClientsCount(): number\\n\\n// Obter informações de clientes\\ngetClientsInfo(): any[]\\n\\n// Obter histórico de mensagens\\ngetMessageHistory(limit: number = 100): WebSocketMessage[]\\n```\\n\\n**Exemplo de Uso (Backend):**\\n\\n```typescript\\nconst wss = new WebSocketServerComplete(httpServer, 8080);\\n\\n// Enviar evento de presença\\nwss.broadcastAttendanceEvent({\\n  type: 'attendance',\\n  studentId: 'student-123',\\n  studentName: 'João Silva',\\n  cameraId: 'camera-1',\\n  cameraName: 'Entrada Principal',\\n  status: 'present',\\n  confidence: 0.95,\\n  timestamp: Date.now(),\\n});\\n\\n// Enviar alerta\\nwss.broadcastAlertEvent({\\n  type: 'alert',\\n  severity: 'warning',\\n  title: 'Câmera Offline',\\n  message: 'Câmera da entrada principal está offline',\\n  timestamp: Date.now(),\\n});\\n```\\n\\n**Exemplo de Uso (Frontend React):**\\n\\n```typescript\\nimport { useWebSocket } from '../hooks/useWebSocket';\\n\\nfunction Dashboard() {\\n  const { isConnected, lastMessage } = useWebSocket();\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (lastMessage?.type === 'attendance') {\\n      console.log(`Aluno ${lastMessage.data.studentName} presente`);\\n    }\\n  }, [lastMessage]);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div>\\n      <p>Status: {isConnected ? '🟢 Conectado' : '🔴 Desconectado'}</p>\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3️⃣ IPC Handlers para Comunicação Electron-React\\n\\n### Arquivo: `handlers-complete.ts`\\n\\n**Responsabilidades:**\\n- Criar handlers IPC para comunicação Electron-React\\n- Expor funcionalidades do backend para a UI\\n- Validar e tratar erros\\n- Retornar respostas estruturadas\\n\\n**Categorias de Handlers:**\\n\\n### Câmeras\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Iniciar captura\\nipcMain.handle('camera:start', async (event, cameraId: string) => {...})\\n\\n// Parar captura\\nipcMain.handle('camera:stop', async (event, cameraId: string) => {...})\\n\\n// Obter status\\nipcMain.handle('camera:status', async (event, cameraId: string) => {...})\\n\\n// Listar câmeras\\nipcMain.handle('camera:list', async (event) => {...})\\n\\n// Adicionar câmera\\nipcMain.handle('camera:add', async (event, cameraData: any) => {...})\\n```\\n\\n### Presença\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Obter presença do aluno\\nipcMain.handle('attendance:get', async (event, studentId: string, date: string) => {...})\\n\\n// Obter estatísticas\\nipcMain.handle('attendance:stats', async (event, startDate: string, endDate: string) => {...})\\n```\\n\\n### Alunos\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Listar alunos\\nipcMain.handle('students:list', async (event) => {...})\\n\\n// Adicionar aluno\\nipcMain.handle('students:add', async (event, studentData: any) => {...})\\n\\n// Treinar aluno\\nipcMain.handle('students:train', async (event, studentId: string, photoUrls: string[]) => {...})\\n```\\n\\n### Relatórios\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Gerar relatório\\nipcMain.handle('reports:attendance', async (event, filters: any) => {...})\\n\\n// Exportar PDF\\nipcMain.handle('reports:export-pdf', async (event, reportData: any) => {...})\\n\\n// Exportar Excel\\nipcMain.handle('reports:export-excel', async (event, reportData: any) => {...})\\n```\\n\\n### Alertas\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Listar alertas\\nipcMain.handle('alerts:list', async (event, filters?: any) => {...})\\n\\n// Marcar como lido\\nipcMain.handle('alerts:mark-read', async (event, alertId: string) => {...})\\n```\\n\\n### Sistema\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Obter status\\nipcMain.handle('system:status', async (event) => {...})\\n\\n// Fazer backup\\nipcMain.handle('system:backup', async (event) => {...})\\n\\n// Restaurar backup\\nipcMain.handle('system:restore', async (event, backupId: string) => {...})\\n\\n// Obter logs\\nipcMain.handle('system:logs', async (event, limit: number = 100) => {...})\\n```\\n\\n**Exemplo de Uso (Frontend):**\\n\\n```typescript\\nimport { useIPC } from '../hooks/useIPC';\\n\\nfunction CameraManager() {\\n  const { invoke } = useIPC();\\n\\n  const handleStartCamera = async (cameraId: string) => {\\n    const result = await invoke('camera:start', cameraId);\\n    if (result.success) {\\n      console.log('Câmera iniciada');\\n    } else {\\n      console.error(result.error);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <button onClick={() => handleStartCamera('camera-1')}>\\n      Iniciar Câmera\\n    </button>\\n  );\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4️⃣ Testes End-to-End do Pipeline Completo\\n\\n### Arquivo: `EndToEndTesting.ts`\\n\\n**Responsabilidades:**\\n- Executar suite completa de testes\\n- Validar cada etapa do pipeline\\n- Gerar relatórios de teste\\n- Medir performance\\n\\n**Testes Implementados:**\\n\\n1. **Database Connection** - Validar conexão com BD\\n2. **Database Schema** - Verificar tabelas necessárias\\n3. **Data Integrity** - Validar integridade dos dados\\n4. **Face Embedding Extraction** - Testar extração de embeddings\\n5. **Face Similarity Calculation** - Testar cálculo de similaridade\\n6. **Student Training** - Testar treinamento de alunos\\n7. **Camera Connection** - Validar conexão com câmeras\\n8. **Frame Processing** - Testar processamento de frames\\n9. **Detection Accuracy** - Validar precisão de detecção\\n10. **Attendance Recording** - Testar registro de presença\\n11. **End-to-End Flow** - Testar fluxo completo\\n12. **Performance** - Medir performance do sistema\\n\\n**Métodos Principais:**\\n\\n```typescript\\n// Executar suite completa\\nasync runFullTestSuite(): Promise<EndToEndTestReport>\\n\\n// Obter relatório formatado\\nprivate generateReport(totalDuration: number): EndToEndTestReport\\n\\n// Imprimir relatório\\nprivate printReport(report: EndToEndTestReport): void\\n```\\n\\n**Exemplo de Uso:**\\n\\n```typescript\\nconst tester = new EndToEndTesting();\\nconst report = await tester.runFullTestSuite();\\n\\nconsole.log(`Total de Testes: ${report.totalTests}`);\\nconsole.log(`✅ Passaram: ${report.passedTests}`);\\nconsole.log(`❌ Falharam: ${report.failedTests}`);\\nconsole.log(`⏱️  Duração: ${report.totalDuration}ms`);\\n```\\n\\n**Estrutura do Relatório:**\\n\\n```typescript\\ninterface EndToEndTestReport {\\n  timestamp: Date;\\n  totalTests: number;\\n  passedTests: number;\\n  failedTests: number;\\n  skippedTests: number;\\n  totalDuration: number;\\n  results: TestResult[];\\n  systemMetrics: any;\\n}\\n\\ninterface TestResult {\\n  name: string;\\n  status: 'passed' | 'failed' | 'skipped';\\n  duration: number;\\n  error?: string;\\n  details?: any;\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🔗 Integração dos 4 Passos\\n\\n### Fluxo Completo:\\n\\n```\\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n│                    APLICATIVO ELECTRON                      │\\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n│                                                             │\\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\\n│  │         INTERFACE REACT (Dashboard, etc)             │  │\\n│  │                                                      │  │\\n│  │  ◄─── IPC Handlers (Passo 3) ───►                  │  │\\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\\n│                      ▲                                      │\\n│                      │ IPC                                  │\\n│                      ▼                                      │\\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\\n│  │         BACKEND (Node.js/Electron)                  │  │\\n│  │                                                      │  │\\n│  │  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │  │\\n│  │  │  ProcessingPipeline                            │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ VideoCapture                               │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ FrameProcessor (YOLO)                      │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ FaceRecognitionIntegration (Passo 1) ◄─┐  │ │  │\\n│  │  │  └─ PresenceTracker                          │  │ │  │\\n│  │  └────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │  │\\n│  │                      │                              │  │\\n│  │                      ▼                              │  │\\n│  │  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │  │\\n│  │  │  WebSocketServer (Passo 2)                     │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ Attendance Events                          │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ Alert Events                               │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ Camera Status Events                        │ │  │\\n│  │  │  └─ System Metrics Events                       │ │  │\\n│  │  └────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │  │\\n│  │                      │                              │  │\\n│  │                      ▼                              │  │\\n│  │  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │  │\\n│  │  │  Database (MySQL/SQLite)                       │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ students                                   │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ cameras                                    │ │  │\\n│  │  │  ├─ attendance                                 │ │  │\\n│  │  │  └─ alerts                                     │ │  │\\n│  │  └────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │  │\\n│  │                                                      │  │\\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\\n│                                                             │\\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │\\n│  │  EndToEndTesting (Passo 4)                           │  │\\n│  │  ├─ Validar cada componente                          │  │\\n│  │  ├─ Testar fluxo completo                            │  │\\n│  │  └─ Gerar relatório                                  │  │\\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │\\n│                                                             │\\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📊 Checklist de Implementação\\n\\n- [x] FaceRecognitionIntegration.ts\\n  - [x] processDetection()\\n  - [x] findSimilarStudents()\\n  - [x] calculateSimilarity()\\n  - [x] recordAttendance()\\n  - [x] trainStudent()\\n  - [x] getStudentAttendanceReport()\\n  - [x] getAttendanceStats()\\n\\n- [x] WebSocketServerComplete.ts\\n  - [x] setupConnectionHandler()\\n  - [x] broadcastAttendanceEvent()\\n  - [x] broadcastAlertEvent()\\n  - [x] broadcastCameraStatusEvent()\\n  - [x] broadcastSystemMetricsEvent()\\n  - [x] getConnectedClientsCount()\\n  - [x] getClientsInfo()\\n  - [x] getMessageHistory()\\n\\n- [x] handlers-complete.ts\\n  - [x] camera:start, camera:stop, camera:status, camera:list, camera:add\\n  - [x] attendance:get, attendance:stats\\n  - [x] students:list, students:add, students:train\\n  - [x] reports:attendance, reports:export-pdf, reports:export-excel\\n  - [x] alerts:list, alerts:mark-read\\n  - [x] system:status, system:backup, system:restore, system:logs\\n\\n- [x] EndToEndTesting.ts\\n  - [x] runFullTestSuite()\\n  - [x] 12 testes implementados\\n  - [x] generateReport()\\n  - [x] printReport()\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 🚀 Próximos Passos\\n\\nCom os 4 passos críticos implementados, o sistema está pronto para:\\n\\n1. **Testes em Produção** - Validar com dados reais\\n2. **Otimizações** - Melhorar performance\\n3. **Passos 5-10 (ALTA)** - Implementar MVP completo\\n4. **Passos 11-20** - Qualidade e polimento\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 📞 Suporte\\n\\nPara dúvidas sobre implementação, consulte:\\n- `SCALABILITY_ANALYSIS.md` - Requisitos de hardware\\n- `ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md` - Topologias de arquitetura\\n- `MIGRATION_PLAYBOOK.md` - Guia de migração\\n":[1,2]},"outlinks":[],"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"docs/60_Registro_de_Execucao/CRITICAL_STEPS_IMPLEMENTATION.md","last_embed":{"hash":"5kafo3","at":1774741628200}},